 &nbsp; 
 
 Mady again thinking about this NYMag story on how AI overviews are so good, they're taking eyeballs away from YouTube tutorials.

 Selfishly, I'm worried about how this will impact social video. The amount of AI slop on my social feeds is really helping decrease my personal screen time, which is nice! But as someone who makes a lot of video content explaining my reporting, all this is making me nervous about social video's place in an agentic world. 
 
